 ('ENT_DRZ_HAMZA','PER_DRUZE','Persian founder-theologian of the Druze daʿwa (fl. 1017-21); chief organizer, held as the human manifestation of al-Aql (Universal Intellect). Historically attested. HOMONYM: distinct from ENT_ISL_HAMZA (Hamza ibn Abd al-Muttalib, uncle of the Prophet Muhammad).'),
